cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the FORGE-S dataset or tool, please cite the paper below."
title: "FORGE-S: A Large-Scale Solana Program Vulnerability Dataset and Construction Tool"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  FORGE-S is the largest public dataset of real-world Solana program
  vulnerabilities: 2,603 CWE-classified findings extracted from 308
  professional audit reports covering 353 Solana projects, with the audited
  Rust source code and file-level vulnerability locations. It also includes
  FORGE-S, the LLM-driven pipeline (extraction, CWE classification, source
  fetching, and localization) that built the dataset, extending the FORGE
  framework to Solana.
